  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看算力。",
   "spoken": "先看算力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.433
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "51% 攻击分四步。",
   "spoken": "百分之 51 攻击分四步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 2.86,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 2.955,
   "speechEnd": 4.626
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "攻击者在交易所充值一大笔币，同时私下挖一条不包含这笔充值的链。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在交易所充值一大笔币，同时私下挖一条不包含这笔充值的链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 5.08,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 5.172,
   "speechEnd": 10.949
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "交易所等够确认数入账，他把币卖掉，提走别的资产。",
   "spoken": "交易所等够确认数入账，他把币卖掉，提走别的资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 11.38,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 11.38,
   "speechEnd": 15.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "然后他公开私下那条更长的链，网络发生重组。",
   "spoken": "然后他公开私下那条更长的链，网络发生虫组。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 15.76,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 15.862,
   "speechEnd": 19.903
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "充值交易消失，币回到他手里，交易所账上多出一笔不存在的充值。",
   "spoken": "充值交易消失，币回到他手里，交易所账上多出一笔不存在的充值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 20.3,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 20.3,
   "speechEnd": 26.033
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "再猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 26.44,
   "dur": 0.96,
   "speechStart": 26.44,
   "speechEnd": 27.203
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "攻击者有 60% 算力，确认数从 6 提高到 600，成功概率降多少？",
   "spoken": "攻击者有百分之 60 算力，确认数从 6 提高到 600，成功概率降多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 27.62,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 27.62,
   "speechEnd": 33.117
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "答案是不降。",
   "spoken": "答案是不降。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 33.8,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 33.8,
   "speechEnd": 35.154
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "算力超过一半，攻击者最终一定能追上。",
   "spoken": "算力超过一半，攻击者最终一定能追上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 35.54,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 35.54,
   "speechEnd": 38.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "加确认数，只增加他租算力的时间和成本。",
   "spoken": "加确认数，只增加他租算力的时间和成本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 39.36,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 39.36,
   "speechEnd": 43.24
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "所以小算力链的确认数，是一个经济问题。",
   "spoken": "所以小算力链的确认数，是一个经济问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 43.66,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 43.66,
   "speechEnd": 47.132
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "租算力的成本，必须高于能双花的金额。",
   "spoken": "租算力的成本，必须高于能双花的金额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 47.56,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 47.659,
   "speechEnd": 51.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2019 年 1 月，Ethereum Classic 被深度重组和双花，约 110 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2019 年 1 月，Ethereum Classic 被深度虫组和双花，约 110 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 51.46,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 51.46,
   "speechEnd": 57.688
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "Coinbase 发现后，暂停了 ETC 的收付。",
   "spoken": "Coinbase 发现后，暂停了 ETC 的收付。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 58.08,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 58.181,
   "speechEnd": 60.684
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2020 年 8 月，它一个月内被攻击三次，第一次双花约 560 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 8 月，它一个月内被攻击三次，第一次双花约 560 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 61.1,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 61.1,
   "speechEnd": 67.896
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "之后，Coinbase 把 ETC 的充值确认时间，提高到约两周。",
   "spoken": "之后，Coinbase 把 ETC 的充值确认时间，提高到约两周。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 68.28,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 68.28,
   "speechEnd": 72.8
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "多数算力，也不一定要持续拥有。",
   "spoken": "多数算力，也不一定要持续拥有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 73.22,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 73.316,
   "speechEnd": 75.762
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "自私挖矿，是把挖到的块先扣住，再择机一次性释放。",
   "spoken": "自私挖矿，是把挖到的块先扣住，再择机一次性释放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 76.16,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 76.16,
   "speechEnd": 80.789
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，Monero 出现史上最深的 18 块重组。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，Monero 出现史上最深的 18 块虫组。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 81.18,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 81.286,
   "speechEnd": 85.352
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "矿池 Qubic 公开说用了自私挖矿。",
   "spoken": "矿池 Qubic 公开说用了自私挖矿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 85.8,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 85.8,
   "speechEnd": 88.878
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "研究者认为，它的日均算力没有达到 51%。",
   "spoken": "研究者认为，它的日均算力没有达到百分之 51。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
   "start": 89.3,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 89.401,
   "speechEnd": 93.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "交易所要按租算力的成本和充值金额，定确认数，设单笔和单日上限。",
   "spoken": "交易所要按租算力的成本和充值金额，定确认数，设单笔和单日上限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg3-22.wav",
   "start": 93.76,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 93.76,
   "speechEnd": 100.426
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "重组深度超过阈值，自动暂停这条链的充提。",
